Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 21:26:10 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] ets2nav-local: load map data on first use; lazy worker
 pools; no env dump

The server loaded both maps (ETS2 + ATS) and spun up 24 workers, each with a
copy of its map's data, before listening (~38 s). Now only PRELOAD_MAPS
(default europe) is loaded up front, other maps / search indexes / job data /
worker pools are created on first use, pools start with one worker (~17 s).
Also drop the raw process.env dump (user paths in shared logs).
